B.aYw=s(['This Privacy Policy explains how Sonaris, Inc. ("Sonaris," "we," "us," or "our") collects, uses, discloses, and protects personal information when you use Sonaris Pulse and related services (the "Service").',"The Service is an enterprise energy-intelligence platform used by industrial plants, partners, and auditors to capture scan evidence, manage assets, generate reports, and coordinate maintenance workflows.","We process personal information in accordance with applicable law, including the EU General Data Protection Regulation (GDPR), the UK GDPR, the California Consumer Privacy Act as amended by the CPRA (CCPA/CPRA), and other US state privacy laws where they apply.","If your organization has a separate agreement with us (such as a Data Processing Agreement or enterprise order form), that agreement governs where it conflicts with this Policy for organization-controlled processing."],t.s)
B.aaA=new A.hP("introduction","1. Introduction",B.aYw,B.aO,null)
B.aYV=s(["For most account and Service usage data, Sonaris is the data controller.","When your employer or plant operator provisions your account, your organization may be the controller of certain workforce data, and Sonaris acts as a processor on their instructions. In those cases, contact your organization administrator for workplace privacy questions; we will support them as required by contract and law.","Contact our Privacy Office:\n\u2022 Email: privacy@sonaris.com\n\u2022 Support: support@sonaris.com\n\u2022 Mail: Sonaris, Inc., Attn: Privacy Office"],t.s)
B.aav=new A.hP("controller","2. Who Is Responsible for Your Information",B.aYV,B.aO,null)
B.aVC=s(["We collect information in three ways: you provide it, it is generated through your use of the Service, and we receive it from your organization or integrations."],t.s)
B.aZs=s(["Account & profile: name, work email, role, plant assignment, job title, phone (if provided), authentication credentials, and session tokens.","Operational & scan data: asset identifiers, scan results, thermal/acoustic metadata, timestamps, locations, work orders, notes, and audit exports you create.","Device & technical data: device type, browser, IP address, app version, crash logs, and security/event logs needed to operate and protect the Service.","Preferences & settings: notification choices, locale, currency, privacy toggles, and integration settings you configure in the app.","Support & communications: messages you send to support, feedback, and pilot requests.","Payment & billing (where applicable): billing contact, subscription tier, and invoices processed by our payment providers \u2014 we do not store full payment card numbers."],t.s)
B.aaw=new A.hP("collection","3. Information We Collect",B.aVC,B.aZs,null)
B.aXx=s(["We use personal information only for legitimate purposes connected to the Service:"],t.s)
B.aYO=s(["Provide and secure the Service (contract / legitimate interests).","Authenticate users, enforce role-based access, and prevent fraud or abuse (contract / legitimate interests / legal obligation).","Sync scans, generate reports, and enable CMMS and API integrations you enable (contract).","Send service, security, and billing notices you request or we are required to send (contract / legal obligation).","Improve reliability and product quality using aggregated or de-identified analytics where permitted and where you have not opted out (legitimate interests / consent where required).","Comply with law, respond to lawful requests, and protect rights and safety (legal obligation / legitimate interests)."],t.s)
B.aaI=new A.hP("purposes","4. How We Use Information & Legal Bases (GDPR)",B.aXx,B.aYO,"Where GDPR applies and we rely on legitimate interests, you may object as described in Section 10. Where we rely on consent, you may withdraw it at any time without affecting prior processing.")
B.aH4=s(["On web deployments we use cookies and local storage to keep you signed in, remember preferences, and \u2014 if you allow \u2014 understand how the Service is used."],t.s)
B.b_1=s(["Strictly necessary: session tokens, security, and load balancing. These cannot be disabled without breaking core functionality.","Functional: saved preferences such as theme, locale, and display settings.","Analytics (optional): product usage metrics to improve performance and reliability. You can disable analytics in Settings \u2192 Privacy \u2192 Product analytics."],t.s)
B.aau=new A.hP("cookies","5. Cookies & Similar Technologies",B.aH4,B.b_1,"We do not use cookies to sell your personal information. Browser controls and in-app privacy settings let you limit non-essential technologies.")
B.aUP=s(["We do not sell your personal information. We do not share it for cross-context behavioral advertising.","We disclose information only as follows:"],t.s)
B.aXc=s(["Within your organization: administrators and authorized roles per your plant's access configuration.","Service providers: hosting, email, security monitoring, and support vendors bound by confidentiality and data-protection terms.","Integrations you enable: CMMS, cloud storage, or API consumers authorized by your admin.","Legal & safety: when required by law, court order, or to protect users, the Service, or the public.","Business transfers: in connection with a merger, acquisition, or asset sale, subject to continued protections."],t.s)
B.aaB=new A.hP("sharing","6. How We Share Information",B.aUP,B.aXc,null)
B.aWs=s(["Sonaris may process and store information in the United States and other countries where we or our providers operate.","When we transfer personal information from the EEA, UK, or Switzerland to countries without an adequacy decision, we use appropriate safeguards such as Standard Contractual Clauses (SCCs) and supplementary measures where required.","Enterprise customers may request information about transfer mechanisms via privacy@sonaris.com or their Data Processing Agreement."],t.s)
B.aaC=new A.hP("transfers","7. International Data Transfers",B.aWs,B.aO,null)
B.aUG=s(["We retain personal information only as long as needed for the purposes in this Policy, including to provide the Service, meet legal obligations, resolve disputes, and enforce agreements.","Typical retention: account data for the life of the account plus a limited backup period; scan and audit records per your organization's configuration and contract; security logs for a defined period; support tickets for operational follow-up.","When data is no longer needed, we delete or de-identify it in accordance with our retention schedule and your organization's instructions where we act as processor."],t.s)
B.aaz=new A.hP("retention","8. Data Retention",B.aUG,B.aO,null)
B.b_E=s(["We implement technical and organizational measures appropriate to the risk, including encryption in transit, access controls, tenant isolation, audit logging, and regular security review.","No method of transmission or storage is completely secure. Report suspected incidents to privacy@sonaris.com promptly."],t.s)
B.aaF=new A.hP("security","9. Security",B.b_E,B.aO,null)
B.aZH=s(["If GDPR or UK GDPR applies, you may have the right to:"],t.s)
B.aUa=s(["Access a copy of your personal information.","Rectify inaccurate information.",'Erase information in certain circumstances ("right to be forgotten").',"Restrict or object to certain processing, including direct marketing.","Data portability for information you provided, where technically feasible.","Withdraw consent where processing is consent-based.","Lodge a complaint with your local supervisory authority."],t.s)
B.aaG=new A.hP("rights_eu","10. Your Rights \u2014 European Economic Area & UK",B.aZH,B.aUa,"To exercise these rights, use Settings \u2192 Privacy \u2192 Download my data or Delete account, or email privacy@sonaris.com. We respond within one month, extendable where permitted. We may verify your identity before fulfilling a request.")
B.aVJ=s(["Residents of California and certain other US states have rights regarding personal information, which may include:"],t.s)
B.aUm=s(["Right to know what categories and specific pieces of personal information we collect, use, and disclose.","Right to delete personal information, subject to legal exceptions.","Right to correct inaccurate personal information.",'Right to opt out of the "sale" or "sharing" of personal information \u2014 Sonaris does not sell or share personal information for cross-context behavioral advertising.',"Right to limit use of sensitive personal information where applicable.","Right to non-discrimination for exercising privacy rights."],t.s)
B.aaD=new A.hP("rights_us","11. Your Rights \u2014 United States",B.aVJ,B.aUm,"California residents may submit requests via privacy@sonaris.com or in-app privacy controls. We verify requests as required by law. Authorized agents may submit requests with proof of authority. Shine the Light: we do not disclose personal information to third parties for their direct marketing.")
B.amv=s(["The Service is intended for authorized enterprise users and is not directed to children under 16 (or the age required in your jurisdiction).","We do not knowingly collect personal information from children. If you believe a child has provided information, contact privacy@sonaris.com and we will delete it."],t.s)
B.aax=new A.hP("children","12. Children's Privacy",B.amv,B.aO,null)
B.aVk=s(["Sonaris Pulse uses automated analysis (including AI-assisted models) to classify scan severity, estimate savings, and recommend maintenance actions.","These outputs support human review in operational workflows. They do not produce legal or similarly significant effects solely by automated means without human oversight appropriate to your organization's processes.","You may contact privacy@sonaris.com for information about logic involved and how to request human review where GDPR Article 22 applies."],t.s)
B.aaE=new A.hP("automated","13. Automated Decision-Making",B.aVk,B.aO,null)
B.aHa=s(["If your organization subscribes to Sonaris Pulse, your administrator controls user provisioning, roles, retention, and integrations. Workforce data is processed under your organization's instructions and applicable contract.","Enterprise customers may execute a Data Processing Agreement (DPA) covering processor obligations, sub-processors, security, and breach notification.","Contact your account representative or privacy@sonaris.com for DPA requests."],t.s)
B.aay=new A.hP("enterprise","14. Enterprise Customers",B.aHa,B.aO,null)
B.aYG=s(["We may update this Policy to reflect legal, technical, or business changes. We will post the updated version in the app with a revised effective date.","For material changes, we will provide additional notice (for example, in-app message or email to account holders) where required by law.","Continued use after the effective date constitutes acceptance where permitted; otherwise we will seek consent as required."],t.s)
B.aat=new A.hP("changes","15. Changes to This Policy",B.aYG,B.aO,null)
B.aXa=s(["Privacy Office \u2014 Sonaris, Inc.\nEmail: privacy@sonaris.com\nSupport: support@sonaris.com","EU/EEA users may contact your local data protection authority. For example, your national supervisory authority list is published by the European Data Protection Board.","UK users may contact the Information Commissioner's Office (ICO).","California users may contact the California Privacy Protection Agency."],t.s)
B.aaH=new A.hP("contact","16. Contact & Supervisory Authorities",B.aXa,B.aO,null)
